  "purpose" : "(Clinical Focus: This value set contains concepts that represent a solid organ transplant.),(Data Element Scope: This value set may use Quality Data Model (QDM) category related to procedure.The intent of this data element is to identify patients who have had a solid organ transplant.),(Inclusion Criteria: Includes only relevant SNOMED concepts associated with transplantation of solid organs.),(Exclusion Criteria: Exclude relevant SNOMED concepts associated with codes representing tissue and other non-solid organ transplants.)",
